WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:18.523
Nina took her apron out of her backpack.

2
00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:23.506
Miss Shelly had asked all the Kids Central kids to bring aprons today.

3
00:00:23.507 --> 00:00:26.098
Nina's apron was purple.

4
00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:30.025
It was a present from Aunt Sujong in Korea.

5
00:00:30.026 --> 00:00:34.705
Aunt Sujong visited the United States once a year.

6
00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:39.587
"Hey, Bobby. Nice apron," Jason teased.

7
00:00:39.588 --> 00:00:43.298
Bobby was wearing a pink apron with ruffles.

8
00:00:43.299 --> 00:00:46.987
"It's my sister's," Bobby grumbled.

9
00:00:46.988 --> 00:00:49.531
"What are you wearing?"

10
00:00:49.532 --> 00:00:53.042
"My old pajamas," Jason said.

11
00:00:53.043 --> 00:00:58.488
"It's also my smock for art class."

12
00:00:58.489 --> 00:01:02.393
"Buon giorno!" Miss Shelly called.

13
00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:05.227
She was wearing a chef's hat.

14
00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:08.450
"That's Italian for 'hello.'

15
00:01:08.451 --> 00:01:13.551
Today we're going to make my favorite Italian food—pizza!

16
00:01:13.552 --> 00:01:19.640
But we're going to make small snack pizzas called pizza bagels!"

17
00:01:19.641 --> 00:01:21.819
"I've eaten bagels.

18
00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:24.077
And I've eaten pizza.

19
00:01:24.078 --> 00:01:29.678
But I've never eaten pizza bagels before!" Nina said.

20
00:01:29.679 --> 00:01:38.103
"First you can each take six bagel halves from the basket," Miss Shelly told them.

21
00:01:38.104 --> 00:01:44.005
"Whoa! We each get six?" Bobby cried.

22
00:01:44.006 --> 00:01:49.507
"Yep. What's next, Bobby?" Miss Shelly asked.

23
00:01:49.508 --> 00:01:54.178
"Spread pizza sauce on the bagels," Bobby read.

24
00:01:54.179 --> 00:02:00.439
Nina spread the sauce in a circle on her bagels.

25
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:03.109
"Wait, I need more."

26
00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:07.201
Jason leaned over the table to take the jar from Nina.

27
00:02:07.202 --> 00:02:10.149
His bagels slipped off his dish.

28
00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:15.395
"Ah!" Nina jumped out of the way of the sliding bagels.

29
00:02:15.396 --> 00:02:21.198
Splat. Jason's bagels landed sauce-side down on the gym floor.

30
00:02:21.199 --> 00:02:27.335
"Oh!" Jason moaned. "Now what, Miss Shelly?"

31
00:02:27.336 --> 00:02:31.147
"Sorry. We only had enough for six each.

32
00:02:31.148 --> 00:02:35.715
Someone will have to share with you," Miss Shelly answered.

33
00:02:35.716 --> 00:02:39.414
"I'll share mine," Bobby said.

34
00:02:39.415 --> 00:02:45.887
"Thank you, Bobby," said Miss Shelly. "That's very kind."

35
00:02:45.888 --> 00:02:50.161
"Now sprinkle shredded cheese on the bagels.

36
00:02:50.162 --> 00:02:58.755
Not too much," Nina read out loud.

37
00:02:58.756 --> 00:03:03.683
"Yum, I love cheese!" Izzie cried.

38
00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:05.868
"Then choose a topping.

39
00:03:05.869 --> 00:03:12.065
Sprinkle it over the cheese," Izzie read.

40
00:03:12.066 --> 00:03:14.245
"I pick bacon."

41
00:03:14.246 --> 00:03:17.751
"I pick olives," Nina said.

42
00:03:17.752 --> 00:03:21.180
"Look! I'm making a pizza pie!"

43
00:03:21.181 --> 00:03:23.655
The girls turned around.

44
00:03:23.656 --> 00:03:27.129
Bobby was tossing two bagels in the air.

45
00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.960
He was pretending to make pizza dough.

46
00:03:29.961 --> 00:03:33.430
Jason was laughing.

47
00:03:33.431 --> 00:03:39.097
"Boys, do not play with food," Miss Shelly warned.

48
00:03:39.098 --> 00:03:43.287
"Whoa!" Bobby tripped and bumped into Jason.

49
00:03:43.288 --> 00:03:46.548
Their plate went flying into the air.

50
00:03:46.549 --> 00:03:48.693
Jason leaped to catch it.

51
00:03:48.694 --> 00:03:52.533
But it was too late.

52
00:03:52.534 --> 00:03:57.537
"Six more pizza bagels gone." Miss Shelly sighed.

53
00:03:57.538 --> 00:04:06.424
"Well, let's put yours in the toaster oven, girls."

54
00:04:06.425 --> 00:04:14.410
"Something is burning!" Miss Shelly ran to the toaster oven.

55
00:04:14.411 --> 00:04:18.127
"My pizza bagels!" Izzie cried.

56
00:04:18.128 --> 00:04:22.323
"Too much cheese," Jason said.

57
00:04:22.324 --> 00:04:25.361
The cheese had dripped off the bagels.

58
00:04:25.362 --> 00:04:28.623
It was burned onto the bottom of the oven.

59
00:04:28.624 --> 00:04:33.170
"But there are still six good pizza bagels here."

60
00:04:33.171 --> 00:04:37.459
Miss Shelly pulled Nina's bagels out of the oven.

61
00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:41.076
"Enough for all of us." Nina smiled.

62
00:04:41.077 --> 00:04:44.311
"Dig in, everyone."

63
00:04:44.312 --> 00:04:49.774
"Thanks. Hooray for Nina!" everyone cheered.

64
00:04:49.775 --> 00:04:54.618
Miss Shelly took off her chef's hat and put it on Nina's head.

65
00:04:54.619 --> 00:05:03.984
Nina beamed. She couldn't wait to make pizza bagels for Aunt Sujong.
